## Click-To-Select

What to test:

- Click a line marker and confirm it grows to indicate selection.
- Click a different marker and confirm the previous selection clears.
- Click an empty area and confirm selection clears.

{% chartExampleRunner title="Click-To-Select" name="click-to-select" type="generated" /%}

## Drag Selection

What to test:

- Drag a rectangle across markers and bars; every item inside is selected.
- Confirm selected items adopt the configured selected style across line, bar, area and range series.

{% chartExampleRunner title="Drag Selection" name="drag-selection" type="generated" /%}

## Multiple Series Selection

What to test:

- Drag-select across several series and confirm items from each series are tracked independently.
- Save the current selection, change data or series, then restore and confirm selection persists.
- Confirm selection styling survives zoom and navigator interactions.

{% chartExampleRunner
    title="Multiple Series"
    name="multiple-series"
    type="generated"
    options={ "exampleHeight": 1000 }
/%}

## Error Bars

What to test:

- Click or drag to select datums and confirm error bars adopt the selected stroke.
- Hover a different datum and confirm highlight styling overrides selection without clearing it.

{% chartExampleRunner title="Error Bars" name="error-bars" type="generated" /%}

## Pie Selection

What to test:

- Click a sector and confirm it offsets outward.
- Click another sector and confirm only one sector is offset at a time.
- Click outside the sectors to clear selection.

{% chartExampleRunner title="Pie Selection" name="pie-selection" type="generated" /%}

## Org Chart

What to test:

- Clicks:
    - With `clickModifier`: clear old selection and set selection to clicked series-node.
    - With Control or Command modifier: adds/remove the clicked series-node to the
      current selection.
- Drags:
    - All containment modes.
    - With/without modifiers (like with clicks).
- Expand/Collapse:
    - Preserves selections.

{% chartExampleRunner title="Org Selection" name="org-selection" type="generated"/%}
